### Customer Registration
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Customer",
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "phone": "01712345678",
  "password": "Customer123!",
  "role": "customer"
}

### Dealer Registration
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Dealer",
  "email": "dealer@test.com",
  "phone": "01812345678",
  "password": "Dealer123!",
  "role": "dealer"
}